		margin-left: 0.35rem;
		color: var(--muted);
		font-size: 0.7rem;
	}
	/* The pink of Meeko's nose: only the instant a signal changes. */
	.signal[data-flash='a'] {
		animation: flash-a 1.1s var(--ease-out);
	}
	.signal[data-flash='b'] {
		animation: flash-b 1.1s var(--ease-out);
